      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halifax%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Halifax Area Historical Society, housed at 228 Market Street, preserves and shares the town’s rich heritage.",
